id: detect/answer
name: brim detect answers with the four margin numbers
prose: "Given a JPEG picture the tool prints one line of four numbers — margin pixels on the top, bottom, left, and right, each side measured on its own. On the attached bordered.jpg (an even 4-pixel frame) it says 4 4 4 4; on clear.jpg (no margin) it says 0 0 0 0. A search band shallower than the frame cuts the numbers down to the band depth: --band 0.01 gives 2 2 2 2 on the 250-pixel side, because evenness stretches to the end of the band and the whole band is the answer. A deeper one leaves the numbers at the frame: --band 0.05 gives 4 4 4 4, and the stated ceiling --band 0.5 (half the side, no more is allowed) works the same. The threshold knob works across its whole valid range: 0.5 given explicitly matches the default; 0, the least aggressive bar, lets evenness stretch through the whole default band, so the answer is the whole band — 62 pixels, a quarter of the 250-pixel side, and on the non-square clear.jpg a fraction of each side on its own: 87 top and bottom of the 350-pixel height, 127 left and right of the 510-pixel width; 1, the most aggressive, leaves nothing even enough, so no margin is found and the answer is zeros. A repeat run on the same picture prints the same line to the letter."
scope:
- main.go
- picture.go
- entropy.go
- margin.go
- go.mod
- testdata/bordered.jpg
- testdata/clear.jpg
covers:
- R1
- R4
rows:
- run: ./brim detect testdata/bordered.jpg
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      4 4 4 4
- run: ./brim detect testdata/clear.jpg
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      0 0 0 0
- run: ./brim detect testdata/bordered.jpg --band 0.01
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      2 2 2 2
- run: ./brim detect testdata/bordered.jpg --band 0.05
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      4 4 4 4
- run: "a=$(./brim detect testdata/bordered.jpg) && b=$(./brim detect testdata/bordered.jpg) && [ \"$a\" = \"$b\" ] && printf '%s\\n' \"$a\""
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      4 4 4 4
- run: ./brim detect testdata/bordered.jpg --threshold 0.5
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      4 4 4 4
- run: ./brim detect testdata/bordered.jpg --threshold 0
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      62 62 62 62
- run: ./brim detect testdata/bordered.jpg --threshold 1
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      0 0 0 0
- run: ./brim detect testdata/clear.jpg --threshold 0
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      87 87 127 127
- run: ./brim detect testdata/bordered.jpg --band 0.5
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      4 4 4 4
